      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 184,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 185,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "These systems are uniquely specialized and are comprised of two independent SCADA systems\nworking in parallel while communicating and sharing data to achieve maximum efficiency.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "These systems are uniquely specialized and are comprised of two independent SCADA systems\nworking in parallel while communicating and sharing data to achieve maximum efficiency.",
